WEBVTT

00:02:28.571 --> 00:02:30.556
nuclear arms treaties,

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.138
consumer and environmental triumphs --

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.443
all sparked by citizen advocates

00:02:36.467 --> 00:02:38.121
and small third parties

00:02:38.145 --> 00:02:40.404
who never won a national election.

00:02:41.547 --> 00:02:44.331
If you're willing to lose persistently,

00:02:44.355 --> 00:02:47.006
your causes can become winners in time.

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:48.236
(Laughter)

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:50.860
The story of how I came
to these civic activities

00:02:50.884 --> 00:02:52.764
may be instructive

00:02:52.788 --> 00:02:56.601
for people who go along
with Senator Daniel Webster's belief,

00:02:57.141 --> 00:03:00.506
"Justice, sir, is the great interest
of man on earth."